      "updated": 1773690267580,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 54.55215894744489,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Assumptions:\n- No CQRS implementation\n- \"materials-query-mgmt\" module will expose REST endpoints to operate\n- RDBMS instead of AWS OpenSearch due to easy develop and availability\n- Keycloak instead of AWs Cognito as Auth Server for security.\n- Goose CLI used for demo chatbot capabilities\n- MCP Inspector used for demo secure RBAC/ABAC \n- Business model entity attached\n\nADRs:\n- Java based application: langchain4j framework for agentic AI implementation.\n- Quarkus for easy and quick development (dev services)\n- BCE pattern for architecture clarity\n- ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Assumptions:\n- No CQRS implementation\n- \"materials-query-mgmt\" module will expose REST endpoints to operate\n- RDBMS instead of AWS OpenSearch due to easy develop and availability\n- Keycloak instead of AWs Cognito as Auth Server for security.\n- Goose CLI used for demo chatbot capabilities\n- MCP Inspector used for demo secure RBAC/ABAC \n- Business model entity attached\n\nADRs:\n- Java based application: langchain4j framework for agentic AI implementation.\n- Quarkus for easy and quick development (dev services)\n- BCE pattern for architecture clarity\n- ",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 934,
      "index": "c0hp",
      "autoResize": true
    },
