      "fontSize": 54.55215894744489,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Functional Requirements: (FRs)\n1. ChatGPT like interface where users can search with natural language.\n\n2. Expose existing APIs for images and Bill of Materials (BOM) as tools to the\nsearch agent to understand which products are using the materials ?\n\n3. Enforce authorizations via role based access control (RBAC) and attribute\nbased access control (ABAC) ?",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements: (FRs)\n1. ChatGPT like interface where users can search with natural language.\n\n2. Expose existing APIs for images and Bill of Materials (BOM) as tools to the\nsearch agent to understand which products are using the materials ?\n\n3. Enforce authorizations via role based access control (RBAC) and attribute\nbased access control (ABAC) ?",
